rtFood #LeftoverMakeovers #PlannedOvers #BudgetMeals"  alt="Tasty cream cheese rotisserie chicken enchiladas recipe pin with an icon that says &#039;new&#039; for this newly created recipe." class="dpsp-post-pinterest-image-hidden-inner  dpsp-post-pinterest-image-hidden-single" loading="lazy" /></noscript></div>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">My <strong>cream cheese rotisserie chicken enchiladas</strong> are a rich, delicious twist on a classic favorite that your whole family will crave. By using a pre-cooked chicken and zesty RoTel, you can have this <strong>decadent, cheesy dinner</strong> on the table with very little effort. It's the perfect way to turn a grocery store staple into a restaurant-quality meal that is absolutely bursting with flavor.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq.jpg" alt="Square overhead image of tasty cream cheese rotisserie chicken enchiladas served on a grey stoneware rimmed plate and topped with a spoonful of sour cream and diced avocado." data-skip-lazy class="wp-image-195200" srcset="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq.jpg 1200w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-300x300.jpg 300w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-600x600.jpg 600w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-400x400.jpg 400w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-500x500.jpg 500w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-360x360.jpg 360w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-720x720.jpg 720w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-180x180.jpg 180w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-96x96.jpg 96w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-sq-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>


