<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The magic here is the balance of textures. While my <strong><a href="https://bakeitwithlove.com/sour-cream-chicken-enchiladas/">sour cream chicken enchiladas</a></strong> are fabulously smooth, adding the cream cheese and RoTel creates a thicker, <strong>more substantial filling</strong> that feels incredibly indulgent. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">By using <strong>both pepper jack and cheddar</strong>, you get a complex and 💯 satisfying 'cheese pull' that offers both sharpness and spice. See all my <strong><a href="https://bakeitwithlove.com/rotisserie-chicken-recipes/" type="post" id="65739">rotisserie chicken recipes</a></strong> here!</p>



