g decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20400'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class=" fsri-image wp-post-image" alt="A square image showing crispy quesadilla wedges stuffed with rotisserie chicken and melted cheese, plated with sour cream and garnished with fresh cilantro leaves." data-pin-nopin="true" aria-hidden="true" data-lazy-srcset="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-400x400.jpg 400w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-300x300.jpg 300w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-600x600.jpg 600w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-500x500.jpg 500w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-360x360.jpg 360w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-720x720.jpg 720w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-180x180.jpg 180w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-96x96.jpg 96w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-150x150.jpg 150w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square.jpg 1200w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-lazy-src="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-400x400.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-400x400.jpg" class=" fsri-image wp-post-image" alt="A square image showing crispy quesadilla wedges stuffed with rotisserie chicken and melted cheese, plated with sour cream and garnished with fresh cilantro leaves." data-pin-nopin="true" aria-hidden="true" srcset="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-400x400.jpg 400w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-300x300.jpg 300w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-600x600.jpg 600w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-500x500.jpg 500w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-360x360.jpg 360w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-720x720.jpg 720w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-180x180.jpg 180w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-96x96.jpg 96w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square-150x150.jpg 150w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rotisserie-chicken-quesadillas-square.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /></noscript><div class="fsri-title">Rotisserie Chicken Quesadillas</div></a></li></ul><div class='feast-category-link'>See more  <a href='https://bakeitwithlove.com/category/recipes/leftover-recipes/leftover-chicken/'>Leftover Chicken →</a></div></div></div></div>



<h2 id="%f0%9f%a5%84-make-ahead-options"   class="wp-block-heading" >🥄 Make Ahead Options</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Enchiladas are one of my favorite meal planning items <strong>to make in advance</strong> for family meals. They can be assembled and covered, then refrigerated until ready to bake the next day. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Freeze by wrapping in plastic cling film and heavy duty aluminum foil. Store in the freezer <strong>for up to 3 months</strong>. Thaw overnight in the fridge before reheating. <strong>*Note: </strong>Dairy-based sauces can <em>sometimes change texture slightly</em> when thawed, but the cream cheese in this recipe helps keep things stable.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To bake from refrigerated or thawed, simply <strong>add about 5-10 minutes</strong> to the cooking time and judge the doneness by when the top is fully melted and bubbling. Also, whenever time allows, I set the dish out to warm for 15-30 minutes prior to baking.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">They're also <strong>extremely delicious</strong> as leftovers! Make an enchilada bowl by reheating them served over rice and refried beans for a leftover makeover that's just as good as the just-cooked enchiladas.</p>



<h2 id="%f0%9f%a5%a1-storing-reheating"   class="wp-block-heading" >🥡 Storing &amp; Reheating</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Once the cream cheese rotisserie chicken enchiladas have cooled to room temperature, transfer them to a shallow airtight storage container. They will stay fresh in the fridge <strong>for up to 3-4 days</strong>.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-freezing-leftovers">Freezing Leftovers</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Freezing the leftover creamy chicken enchiladas is similar to the make ahead instructions above, but you won't be wrapping the entire tray. Use <strong>freezer storage containers</strong> to keep the leftover portion in your freezer for up to 2-3 months. Thaw overnight in the refrigerator before reheating.</p>



