n-Enchiladas-tall1.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="Move over, basic dinners! 💃 These Cream Cheese Rotisserie Chicken Enchiladas are thick, indulgent, and use a grocery store shortcut you'll love. Perfectly cheesy with a hint of RoTel zest; this is a must-make for busy weeknights or any dinner. Yum! 🍗🧀 #EasyDinner #ChickenEnchiladas #RotisserieChicken #ComfortFood #LeftoverMakeovers #PlannedOvers #BudgetMeals" data-pin-title="Delicious Cream Cheese Rotisserie Chicken Enchiladas Recipe" src="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1.jpg" alt="Cheesy, creamy, and absolutely delicious cream cheese rotisserie chicken enchiladas topped with lots of melted cheese plus a dollop of cool sour cream and avocado pieces." class="wp-image-195199" srcset="https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1.jpg 1200w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-200x300.jpg 200w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-400x600.jpg 400w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-360x540.jpg 360w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-180x270.jpg 180w, https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Cream-Cheese-Rotisserie-Chicken-Enchiladas-tall1-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-reheating">Reheating</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To keep that just-baked creaminess, the <strong>reheating method matters</strong>:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Oven-baked <em>(best for overall results)</em></strong>. Place the enchiladas in an oven-safe dish and cover with foil. Bake at 350°F <em>(175°C/Gas Mark 4)</em> for 15-20 minutes. <strong>Removing the foil for the last 5 minutes</strong> helps the cheese get bubbly again without drying out the chicken.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Microwave <em>(best for single portions)</em></strong>. For a quick lunch, heat individual servings on a microwave-safe plate covered <strong>with a damp paper towel</strong> to trap steam. This keeps the flour tortillas from turning into leather and prevents the red sauce from splattering.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Heat for <strong>1 minute on high power</strong>, then in 30-second increments until heated to your satisfaction.</p>



