<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" id="h-hi-there-i-m-angela">Hi there, I'm Angela</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I am an avid vintage cookbook collector, cook, baker, and total foodie. I love sharing new, fun, creative recipes and great classic recipes, just like my Grandma used to make! Every recipe on BIWL is tested to ensure that cooks of any experience level can succeed.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Welcome to Bake It With Love. Enjoy!</p>



